id: flash-drawn
section: The suite's own
item: A movie counts as drawn with 8 or more colours; a planted blank, black and one-colour movie are reported as not drawn
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-plant-frozen.swf
kit: cavekit-flash.md R2
wait rect m 30
wait still m 8
expect flash-drawn m yes
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-plant-blank.swf
wait still m 8
expect flash-drawn m no
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-plant-black.swf
wait still m 8
expect flash-drawn m no
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-plant-one.swf
wait still m 8
expect flash-drawn m no
